  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### I would like to know where occupational pension contributions will go in the tax return.\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at  3:18 PM\n\n\t\tYou may edit the SA100 by using the action drop-down box and click on “SA302 computation” to see the effect of the pension contribution.\n\nSA100 >> SA302 Computation\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nClick here to watch a video on the reflection of Pension Contributions on the SA100 Tax return\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188547\">Self Assessment FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">I would like to know where occupational pension contributions will go in the tax return.\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at  3:18 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You may edit the SA100 by using the action drop-down box and click on “SA302 computation” to see the effect of the pension contribution.<br><br><a href=\"https://app.capium.com/selfassessment/sa100/taxreturn/pt_forms.aspx?sa=edit&amp;id=21335&amp;rid=21335&amp;ref=sa-5\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>SA100 &gt;&gt; SA302 Computation</strong></a><br><br>Please refer below screenshot for more help.</span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074133791/original/cSyqQ-r7FmzX_su1s0dQVadCiSowT6jf7Q.png?1553522697\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074133791/original/cSyqQ-r7FmzX_su1s0dQVadCiSowT6jf7Q.png?1553522697\" data-fileid=\"9074133791\" data-uniquekey=\"1553522686768\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074133792/original/6PeUu0wN3lirIq9NTDgRL5OmJh3iyg_